Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='changeheads', at=datetime(2026, 10, 1, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="A Change rests on its todo's heads, what its writer saw", body="Since 2026-10-01 (Prodrome \\#29) a `Change` rests on its todo's HEADS, what its writer saw, so one writer's content, spec and state writes to a todo are ordered as written; a change written from 2026-09-30 until then rests only on the frontiers of the registers it writes, and a reader that needs an order among those, or among two writers' concurrent writes (undo's stream), breaks the tie by the stamped instant and says so. The inbox needs no order at all (2026-10-01): a proposal's responses write one inflationary register, below.", rationale='Decided 2026-10-01 with Prodrome #29; a change written from 2026-09-30 until then rests only on the frontiers of the registers it writes.', supersedes=()))